Template: note-keeper/public_url
Type: string
Default:
Description: Public base URL:
 Public origin of this NoteKeeper instance, no trailing slash.
 Used for reverse proxies and OAuth redirects.
 .
 Example: https://note.example.com
 Leave empty to infer from the request (localhost / X-Forwarded-*).

Template: note-keeper/port
Type: string
Default: 8080
Description: HTTP listen port:
 TCP port for the web UI and API. Default is 8080.

Template: note-keeper/db_type
Type: select
Choices: sqlite, postgresql
Default: sqlite
Description: Database:
 sqlite — file under /opt/note-keeper/var (no extra packages).
 postgresql — host, database, user, and password are asked next.

Template: note-keeper/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host:

Template: note-keeper/db_port
Type: string
Default: 5432
Description: PostgreSQL port:

Template: note-keeper/db_name
Type: string
Default: notekeeper
Description: PostgreSQL database name:

Template: note-keeper/db_user
Type: string
Default: postgres
Description: PostgreSQL user:

Template: note-keeper/db_password
Type: password
Default:
Description: PostgreSQL password:

Template: note-keeper/google_client_id
Type: string
Default:
Description: Google OAuth client ID (optional):
 Leave empty to disable Google sign-in.

Template: note-keeper/google_client_secret
Type: password
Default:
Description: Google OAuth client secret (optional):
 Leave empty if Google sign-in is disabled.

Template: note-keeper/google_callback
Type: string
Default:
Description: Google OAuth callback URL (optional):
 Leave empty to use ${example}
 Register this exact URI as an authorized redirect in Google Cloud.

Template: note-keeper/yandex_client_id
Type: string
Default:
Description: Yandex OAuth client ID (optional):
 Leave empty to disable Yandex sign-in.

Template: note-keeper/yandex_client_secret
Type: password
Default:
Description: Yandex OAuth client secret (optional):
 Leave empty if Yandex sign-in is disabled.

Template: note-keeper/yandex_callback
Type: string
Default:
Description: Yandex OAuth callback URL (optional):
 Leave empty to use ${example}
 Register this exact URI in Yandex OAuth.
